      "number_raw": "101",
      "source_number": "101",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "This is Junktown. Nice place to live, as long as you stay on our good side",
      "source_text": "This is Junktown. Nice place to live, as long\n as you stay on our good side",
      "source_line_start": 2,
      "source_line_end": 3,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 3,
      "number": 102,
      "number_raw": "102",
      "source_number": "102",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Watch out for Gizmo and his cronies.",
      "source_text": "Watch out for Gizmo and his cronies.",
      "source_line_start": 4,
      "source_line_end": 4,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 4,
      "number": 103,
      "number_raw": "103",
      "source_number": "103",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "I like my boss.",
      "source_text": "I like my boss.",
      "source_line_start": 5,
      "source_line_end": 5,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 5,
      "number": 104,
      "number_raw": "104",
      "source_number": "104",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "You'd better put that away. Junktown is a friendly place, friend, and we want to keep it that way.",
      "source_text": "You'd better put that away. Junktown is a friendly place,\n friend, and we want to keep it that way.",
      "source_line_start": 6,
      "source_line_end": 7,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 6,
      "number": 105,
      "number_raw": "105",
      "source_number": "105",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Put what away?",
      "source_text": "Put what away?",
      "source_line_start": 8,
      "source_line_end": 8,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 7,
      "number": 106,
      "number_raw": "106",
      "source_number": "106",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Don't tell me what to do, loser boy.",
      "source_text": "Don't tell me what to do, loser boy.",
      "source_line_start": 9,
      "source_line_end": 9,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 8,
      "number": 107,
      "number_raw": "107",
      "source_number": "107",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Sounds fair. By the way, what is the local law regarding weapons?",
      "source_text": "Sounds fair. By the way, what is the local law regarding weapons?",
      "source_line_start": 10,
      "source_line_end": 10,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 9,
      "number": 108,
      "number_raw": "108",
      "source_number": "108",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Uh oh.",
      "source_text": "Uh oh.",
      "source_line_start": 11,
      "source_line_end": 11,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 10,
      "number": 109,
      "number_raw": "109",
      "source_number": "109",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Your weapon, idiot. Killian won't take your arms away, but you'd better damn well keep them in your holster.",
      "source_text": "Your weapon, idiot. Killian won't take your arms away, but you'd\n better damn well keep them in your holster.",
      "source_line_start": 12,
      "source_line_end": 13,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 11,
      "number": 110,
      "number_raw": "110",
      "source_number": "110",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Oh, sorry.",
      "source_text": "Oh, sorry.",
      "source_line_start": 14,
      "source_line_end": 14,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 12,
      "number": 111,
      "number_raw": "111",
      "source_number": "111",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "No way! I'm not putting down my shooters for nobody!",
      "source_text": "No way! I'm not putting down my shooters for nobody!",
      "source_line_start": 15,
      "source_line_end": 15,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 13,
      "number": 112,
      "number_raw": "112",
      "source_number": "112",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "You'd better behave, since it's the law, and I enforce the law. Put your weapon away, don't draw it unless in self-defense, and you won't have a problem with us guards.",
      "source_text": "You'd better behave, since it's the law, and I enforce the law.\n Put your weapon away, don't draw it unless in self-defense, and\n you won't have a problem with us guards.",
      "source_line_start": 16,
      "source_line_end": 18,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 14,
      "number": 113,
      "number_raw": "113",
      "source_number": "113",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "[more]",
      "source_text": "[more]",
      "source_line_start": 19,
      "source_line_end": 19,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 15,
      "number": 114,
      "number_raw": "114",
      "source_number": "114",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Disobey the law, and we will return you to the lawless wasteland - dead or alive.",
      "source_text": "Disobey the law, and we will return you to the lawless\n wasteland - dead or alive.",
      "source_line_start": 20,
      "source_line_end": 21,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 16,
      "number": 115,
      "number_raw": "115",
      "source_number": "115",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Sure, since you put it that way.",
      "source_text": "Sure, since you put it that way.",
      "source_line_start": 22,
      "source_line_end": 22,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 17,
      "number": 116,
      "number_raw": "116",
      "source_number": "116",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Bite your laws!",
      "source_text": "Bite your laws!",
      "source_line_start": 23,
      "source_line_end": 23,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 18,
      "number": 117,
      "number_raw": "117",
      "source_number": "117",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Well, uh, fine with me. But you'd better be careful.",
      "source_text": "Well, uh, fine with me. But you'd better be careful.",
      "source_line_start": 24,
      "source_line_end": 24,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 19,
      "number": 118,
      "number_raw": "118",
      "source_number": "118",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Fine, then. Heh.",
      "source_text": "Fine, then. Heh.",
      "source_line_start": 25,
      "source_line_end": 25,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 20,
      "number": 119,
      "number_raw": "119",
      "source_number": "119",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Good you asked. No weapons can be drawn except in self-defense. If you start a fight, it's your fault. Other than that, it's your right to go around armed. Just don't pull a knife or gun without just cause. Have a good day.",
      "source_text": "Good you asked. No weapons can be drawn except in self-defense. If\n you start a fight, it's your fault. Other than that, it's your right\n to go around armed. Just don't pull a knife or gun without just\n cause. Have a good day.",
      "source_line_start": 26,
      "source_line_end": 29,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 21,
      "number": 120,
      "number_raw": "120",
      "source_number": "120",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Thanks - you, too.",
      "source_text": "Thanks - you, too.",
      "source_line_start": 30,
      "source_line_end": 30,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 22,
